  ('qa2-bfaf9c404bb918989e06bb5f', '10004344', 'Financial Guidance Workshops', 'New initiative', 'A series of workshops for TUNDRA Q1 and Q2 students focused on budgeting, financial planning, and accessing additional funding streams.

